{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "f42be8838aeedfb4783cbcf59e84f2f05cb5ea60d82635bc4673d0786db25ef1", "ja": "閉幕、そして……", "zh": "闭幕，然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1f722419f79c2a8ed9e367eb48d6b5cadfc2226f5f5daab9645c827583a75c32", "ja": "真と雪歩のツインライブ公演は大成功。\n劇場の仲間たちにも大好評で、二人もほっと\n胸をなでおろす。皆で打ち上げに向かう中、\n主役の二人は、これからも一緒に頑張ろうと\n約束するのだった。", "zh": "真和雪步的双人演唱会演出大获成功。  \n也深受剧场伙伴们好评，两人都松了口气。大家一起  \n前往庆功宴时，作为主角的两人约定今后也要一起努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6f3d9c3a27575e356cdf872e00350372d7ea262091e8e334b4f9258084b7a629", "ja": "（真と雪歩のツインライブ公演は大盛況で終わった。\n今日は、ささやかながらライブの打ち上げだ！）", "zh": "（真和雪步的双人演唱会圆满落幕。今天虽然规模不大，但要举办演唱会庆功宴啦！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_07_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "97daa20ec93703d4f3ac442a65e688fdb21f338dde3f46bc6f47bf1da38e91f3", "ja": "ふ、二人の王が……離れ離れにならなくて……\nよがっだでずぅぅ！　ぶえぇぇん、お幸せにぃ！", "zh": "两位王者……没有分开……太、太好了呜呜呜！呜哇啊啊，祝你们幸福！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_07_1002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "412775222b162dd93c0c4ffa6576fd463f7905aa2c491c3780b0d2ae490d6613", "ja": "あ、亜利沙ちゃん……。\n公演が終わってから、もう何日もたってるよ？", "zh": "啊，亜利沙……\n公演结束后，都已经过去好几天了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_07_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "de4df2354b8b75156e41a137ddf016935390f24b98f7862f9a7e7661a28e4cdd", "ja": "それだけ感動してくれたってことだよね！　SNSでも\n『涙が止まらん！』『召された！』って見かけたし。", "zh": "这说明你真的被感动得很深嘛！我在社交平台上也看到有人说“眼泪根本停不下来！”“升天了！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_07_1004_007ior", "source_sha256": "5b03528d31393e561b17f78396c787f442efe47ec9f1add5334ab2e181b18a76", "ja": "演出もよかったわね。公演ごとに内容を変えたのも\n大好評じゃない♪", "zh": "演出也很棒呢。每场公演都更换内容，这点也大受好评，不是吗♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_07_1005_002chi", "source_sha256": "4ba409efdf68eae7282e3864f1599fadd956b9335d4e7a05d281690d98f2f492", "ja": "曲の順番を入れ替えることで、解釈が少し変わってくる\nのね。……素敵だった。", "zh": "通过调换曲目顺序，诠释方式也会稍有不同呢。……真的很美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_07_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "a9e9a263a13ed995719f3c6f2a8d1b60d2953d37a531648948e6ca3ac41aedf7", "ja": "へへっ、そうでしょ♪　まあ、そのせいで\n曲順間違えそうになったりしたんだけどねっ。", "zh": "嘿嘿，是吧♪不过，也正因为这样，我差点把歌曲顺序弄错了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_07_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "21d909b461f4f5b4b45bc17ef65ee1db604d487e286d662f23eee754d4500cb7", "ja": "わたし、王様たちがはなればなれになっちゃうところ、\nハラハラしちゃった。", "zh": "国王他们被迫分开的那一段，\n我都替他们捏了一把汗呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_07_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "603d0e6889fa62af16ed81d0995e55b3889449c8e06ef29fd3925dc9dc38b0ae", "ja": "でもね、最後には、むねがじーんとしたの。\nとってもすてきな公えんだったよ！", "zh": "不过，最后还是让我感动得心里一阵发热。\n真是一场特别精彩的公演呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_07_1009_004yuk", "source_sha256": "e7ae174b088df5a201bb1dc9636c3d2dc67728cc3dd704e512442a53da235842", "ja": "育ちゃん……。\nえへへ♪　ありがとう。", "zh": "小育……。\n嘿嘿♪谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_07_1010_007ior", "source_sha256": "57015a41b8b4cba677482aa8536c2fa80b803d683b3c42fd1f1422efde4ea137", "ja": "こんな公演を見せられたら黙ってられないわ。\n新しい公演、伊織ちゃんも絶対挑戦するんだから♪", "zh": "看到这样的演出，我可不能无动于衷。  \n新的演出，伊织也一定要挑战♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_07_1011_002chi", "source_sha256": "2febe589d8a8ceb1ae0eea1c35e59f56492ea08285baeae650c60e9b64d149ae", "ja": "私も、もっと挑戦する姿勢で。\n二人にしっかり、ついていくわ。", "zh": "我也要以更加积极挑战的态度，紧紧跟上你们两位。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_07_1012_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_07_1013_p", "source_sha256": "b91d43857fb8569ea3ebddca89dfed973a9e43a2927a2a618ebbc90b9982be04", "ja": "真、雪歩、そろそろ打ち上げに出発……\nあれ？　なんか人数が増えてないか？", "zh": "真、雪步，我们差不多该出发去庆功宴了……咦？人数是不是变多了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_07_1014_007ior", "source_sha256": "a4debe881ef2074f0c1a839c50a94f29c10d384c3c32d6f469e7ef591a2bedf9", "ja": "あら、やっと迎えに来たの。\nさ、早く会場に案内してちょうだい♪", "zh": "哎呀，你终于来接我们啦。\n好啦，快点带我们去会场吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_07_1015_p", "source_sha256": "0281c8cfd223719a1b7c99d332d3f4fb771ead4b24b7f59f578619e89bf615bf", "ja": "えっ？　もしかして、全員……？", "zh": "咦？难道所有人……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_07_1016_007ior", "source_sha256": "ff533c4a596e7922ea44e4b65cbccb662f2a9ad990584d8e6259af0f8d4f0e99", "ja": "当たり前じゃない。打ち上げなんだから、\n人数が多いほうがいいに決まってるでしょ？", "zh": "那当然啦。既然是庆功宴，\n人多一点肯定才更热闹嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_07_1017_002chi", "source_sha256": "299f5273ae311c2af740494c40749f5f1201a25ba4bd6779add72eeb37f2dbe9", "ja": "今回の公演のこと、もっとたくさん聞かせて\nほしいんです。今後のためにも。", "zh": "关于这次公演的事，我还想听你多讲一些。也是为了今后。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_07_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "ddf8ba1add8bcda0525fa5ce8adcd88de6a2d8aca523e62f71e98c0f56ca2195", "ja": "はいっ、亜利沙は一方的に語りたいです！\nまだ全然足りませんので！！", "zh": "是的，亚利沙想单方面地一直说下去！\n因为还完全不够呢！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_07_1019_030iku", "source_sha256": "3fa02e2cb77e6c814399e1a8f4fc12dff0ee295624ce559698542afb1e712cdc", "ja": "わたしもちょっとだけでいいから、お話ししたいな。\n{$P$}さん、ダメ？", "zh": "我也想稍微聊一会儿，可以吗？\n{$P$}先生，不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_07_1020_006mak", "source_sha256": "9909a9552e0dc151a2a82cd94d09e874cee5b2fcf5c37c92484c8de60c7b3c64", "ja": "{$P$}、みんな準備を手伝ってくれ\nたり、アイディアをくれたりしたんです。ね、雪歩？", "zh": "{$P$}，大家还帮忙准备，\n又给我出主意什么的。对吧，雪步？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_07_1021_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d397152607e20779afdb5d6b92181cbe3ace987da787ae328644878b1b41c38b", "ja": "そうなんです。レッスンの様子を見に来て、教えて\nくれたりもして。だから……。", "zh": "是这样的。他还会来看我们的练习，教我们该怎么做。所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_07_1022_p", "source_sha256": "dee83d8a993647726b259bd06a509818f234a067972ebc10c88950d21e047a15", "ja": "……よし、わかった。なんとかする！", "zh": "……好，我知道了。交给我来想办法吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_07_1023_006mak", "source_sha256": "e7e8266a78304c6acc523897738228ba5aeafedf9dbc31f8042cd8b7897ef1e8", "ja": "ありがとうございます！", "zh": "谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
