{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_07_1029_p", "source_sha256": "86e8db9663990d9d1603df3bf2a4303d19be18d82e14fa080e160269f70d7804", "ja": "とりあえず、店に連絡するか……。\nみんなはエントランスで待っててくれ。それじゃ！", "zh": "总之，先联系一下店家吧……\n你们在入口等着。那就这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_07_1030_007ior", "source_sha256": "c7cd00a54e732608f886bc424f32b5901ba02a01f5868137e6e31f75698f6fdb", "ja": "じゃあ、私たちも準備しないとね。\n感想の続きも聞きたいし、早く行きましょう♪", "zh": "那么，我们也得准备起来了。\n我还想继续听听你的感想，快走吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_07_1031_004yuk", "source_sha256": "abc2c3643df2309437c158679d07a8749cb87161c18fe424718f19f6b5a648d3", "ja": "あ、あのっ、真ちゃん？", "zh": "啊、那个……真？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_07_1032_006mak", "source_sha256": "a49fe233e0413ce9bcba21076cbf8979cc0ff7a67e64ea38929b45e51e6a48b8", "ja": "どうしたの、雪歩？", "zh": "怎么了，雪步？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0404_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0404_story_07_1033_004yuk", "source_sha256": "cb7a81ff2c97ddf7be393ad36792b7799569b2d13d76bfc3fdba0d1d7ff112aa", "ja": "あの……あのね。ツインライブ、すごく大変だったし、\n疲れたけど……。これからも……。", "zh": "那个……是这样的。双人演唱会真的很辛苦，也很累……可是以后也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
